OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian killed in crash during
OL,4,Apolice chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has been killed after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a car during a police
OL,8,Fpursuit in Leeds.
OL,10,FThe 36-year-old woman was struck by a
OL,11,FVauxhall Corsa on Beckett Street at
OL,12,Fabout 09:52 GMT just minutes after it
OL,13,Ffailed to stop for officers on
OL,14,FHarehills Road.
OL,16,FThe car was later found abandoned on
OL,17,FNippet Lane with the occupants having
OL,18,Ffled the scene, West Yorkshire Police
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
